WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
Here’s how LeadRescuePro turns a missed plumbing call into a qualified opportunity.

00:04.600 --> 00:08.600
A homeowner calls your dedicated AI number and says, “No hot water.”

00:08.600 --> 00:13.600
The AI receptionist answers, captures the issue, service area, urgency, and callback time.

00:13.600 --> 00:18.300
Your team receives a clear lead summary, ready for the next conversation.

00:18.300 --> 00:21.500
Direct calls go straight to the AI number.

00:21.500 --> 00:26.000
Overflow and after hours use configured forwarding.
